{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A procedurally-generated detective sandbox game with a whole city of secrets at your fingertips!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986130/extras/This-is-the-one.gif?t=1750972482\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a private investigator in an alternate, hyper-industrialised 1980s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986130/extras/conspiracyboard-letterbox-notext.gif?t=1750972482\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every case is unique and procedural. With different victims, suspects, motives, and clues every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986130/extras/BathroomDeath-letterbox--notext.gif?t=1750972482\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use tools and tactics to uncover the truth. Hack computers, check phone records, search apartments, bribe citizens, and review surveillance footage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986130/extras/Riot-letterbox-notext.gif?t=1750972482\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every door can be opened, every apartment can be searched, every hotel room can be spied on\u2026 The city is your oyster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sleeping with the Fishes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/986130/ea7b5c3ff625f5ba30e8b14564716ed939ff36c1.jpg"},{"name":"Shark Bait","path